    "Baton" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Baton"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Baton"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Baton 不会自行授予访问权限；是否需要网页确认由服务端决定。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Baton never grants access by itself. The service decides whether web approval is required."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Baton 不会自行授予访问权限；是否需要网页确认由服务端决定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Baton 不是浏览器镜像，也不替代你的业务系统。登录、权限、会话和 Agent 仍由原来的网页服务负责；Baton 只是一个随时可加入的手机端。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Baton is not a browser mirror and doesn’t replace your business system. Your web service still owns sign-in, permissions, conversations, and the Agent. Baton is simply a phone client that can join when you need it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Baton 不是浏览器镜像，也不替代你的业务系统。登录、权限、会话和 Agent 仍由原来的网页服务负责；Baton 只是一个随时可加入的手机端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Baton 只使用相机读取网页展示的配对二维码。扫码不会自动授权加入会话。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Baton uses the camera only to read pairing QR codes shown on web pages. Scanning never authorizes access automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Baton 只使用相机读取网页展示的配对二维码。扫码不会自动授权加入会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Baton 的角色" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What Baton does"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Baton 的角色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pairing URL 无效。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The pairing URL is invalid."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pairing URL 无效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为每个 Agent 服务开发或安装一个独立 App，成本很高。Baton 定义了一组标准化协议：只要服务提供者接入协议并展示二维码，你就能用这一款 App 与不同的 Agent 服务交流。手机加入同一段对话后，消息会实时同步，网页原有功能不受影响。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Building or installing a separate app for every Agent service is costly. Baton defines a standard protocol: once a service adopts it and shows a QR code, one app can connect you to many Agent services. After your phone joins the same conversation, messages stay in sync while the web keeps its original capabilities."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为每个 Agent 服务开发或安装一个独立 App，成本很高。Baton 定义了一组标准化协议：只要服务提供者接入协议并展示二维码，你就能用这一款 App 与不同的 Agent 服务交流。手机加入同一段对话后，消息会实时同步，网页原有功能不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
