    "在各种网站服务或应用中，都会看到与 Agent 对话的窗口；但用电脑打字并不总是最方便。有时我们需要用手机实现更灵活的交流，例如语音。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Many websites and apps now offer an Agent conversation, but typing on a computer is not always the easiest way to respond. A phone can be more flexible, especially for voice."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
